afting\n- New environment\n- Crafting guidance system\n- Unlimited resources for this iteration.  Flowers still need to be collected, but won't be consumed in a craft.", "created_date": 1781143326, "id": "27747506044854984", "version": "2.3", "version_code": 202, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5617087244990181", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27760502780221977"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "734146727665258"}]}, "change_log": "MageWorks 2.2.4\n\nNew\n- Iteration on Graveyard Shift nav meshes\n- Fixed an issue with projectile collision\n- Fixed an issue with static lighting across most levels\n- Fixed an issue where the player's first crafted staff would always be empowered with demon magic ink\n\nKnown Issues\n- Boss fight unavailable, but in development\n- Missing shader for spell collection at level endings\n\nIn the works\n- Continued iteration on graveyard shift\n- Continued refining of level design with experimentation\n- Boss fight\n- UX guidance through crafting\n- Keyed loot boxes for lower part of stave", "created_date": 1776367919, "id": "27065720273033568", "version": "2.2.4", "version_code": 201, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5617087244990181", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBin